  "label": "steak recipe is mapped to animal slaughter",
  "description": "The text 'steak recipe:' is mapped onto the visual of the slaughtered cow, creating an analogical mapping where the 'recipe' (a set of instructions for preparing food) is absurdly equated with the violent act of slaughtering an animal. This mapping is central to the meme's dark humor and cynical commentary on consumption, as it juxtaposes the culinary concept with the graphic reality of animal slaughter.",
